title DP-3 · failure of unverified forwarding
actor "Caller A" as C
participant "Forwarding endpoint\n«candidate»" as F
participant "Peer endpoint\n«candidate»" as P
entity "Owner B job" as J
C -> F : request B's job; X-Owner-Id = B
F -> P : copied owner B + shared service secret
